hadiths[188]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3963","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beemar ki ayadat karne wala jannat ke bagh mein hai; phir jab wo us ke paas baithe to rehmat use dhaanp leti hai."
"3964","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beemar ki ayadat karne wala jannat ke bagh mein chalta hai yahan tak ke wapas laut aaye."
"3965","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ayesha jannat mein meri biwi hain."
"3966","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us se dushmani rakhta hai jo Ali se dushmani rakhe."
"3967","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aariyat wapas ki jayegi."
"3968","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ashura daswaan din hai."
"3969","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ka ilaaj Allah ki kitab se karo."
"3970","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag walon ki aksariyat auratein hain."
"3971","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabar ke azaab ka aksar hissa peshaab se hai."
"3972","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah ke bando, apni saffon ko seedha karo warna Allah tumhare chehron ke darmiyan mukhalifat daal dega."
"3973","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah ke bando, Allah ne haraj utha diya hai siwaye us shakhs ke jo kisi se na-haq qarz le; pas ye tangi aur halakat wala hai. Ae Allah ke bando, ilaaj karo, kyunke Allah taala ne koi beemari nahi rakhi magar us ki dawa rakhi hai siwaye aik beemari ke: burhapa."
"3974","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne aur fasad ke daur mein ibadat meri taraf hijrat ki tarah hai."
"3975","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abdullah bin Salam jannat mein das mein se daswein hain."
"3976","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gardan azaad karna ye hai ke use tanha azaad kare, aur gardan chhurana ye hai ke us ke azaad karne mein madad kare."
"3977","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usman meri ummat mein sab se zyada haya-daar hain.. ..."
"3978","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usman haya-daar hain, farishte un se haya karte hain."
"3979","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usman jannat mein hain."
"3980","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ke muamle par taajjub hai: us ka saara muamla us ke liye bhalayi hai, aur ye kisi ke liye nahi siwaye momin ke; agar use khushi pahunche to shukr karta hai to wo us ke liye bhalayi hoti hai, aur agar use takleef pahunche to sabr karta hai to wo us ke liye bhalayi hoti hai."
"3981","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamara Rab us shakhs par taajjub karta hai jo Allah ki raah mein lada phir us ke saathi bhaag gaye to us ne jana jo us par hai phir laut aaya yahan tak ke us ka khoon bahaya gaya; to Allah azza wa jal apne farishton se farmata hai: Mere bande ko dekho, mere paas jo hai us ki raghbat mein aur mere paas jo hai us ke darr se laut aaya yahan tak ke us ka khoon bahaya gaya."
"3982","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamara Rab us qaum par taajjub karta hai jinhein zanjeeron mein jakar kar jannat ki taraf le jaya jata hai."
"3983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe un qaumo par taajjub hai jinhein zanjeeron mein jannat ki taraf hankaya jata hai halanke wo na-pasand karte hain."
"3984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe apne bhai Yusuf ke sabr aur karam par taajjub hai, Allah unhein bakhsh de: jab un ke paas khwab ki tabeer ke liye bheja gaya, aur agar main hota to bahar nikle baghair na karta. Aur mujhe un ke sabr aur karam par taajjub hai, Allah unhein bakhsh de: unhein nikaalne ke liye aaye lekin wo na nikle yahan tak ke unhein apna uzr bataya, aur agar main hota to jaldi karta. Darwaza; aur agar wo baat na hoti to wo qaid mein na rehte jab wo Allah azza wa jal ke siwa aur se khulasa chahte thay."
"3985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe momin par taajjub hai: Allah taala us ke liye jo faisla karta hai wo us ke liye bhalayi hota hai."
"3986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Musalman par taajjub hai: jab use museebat pahunche to sawab ki niyyat kare aur sabr kare, aur jab use bhalayi pahunche to Allah ki hamd kare aur shukr kare; beshak Musalman ko har cheez mein ajr milta hai yahan tak ke luqme mein bhi jo wo apne munh ki taraf uthata hai."
"3987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe apni ummat ke aik giroh par taajjub hai jo samundar mein aise sawaar honge jaise badshah takhton par."
"3988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne jaldi ki ae namazi! Jab namaz parh kar baithe to Allah ki hamd us ki shan ke mutabiq kar, phir mujh par durood bhej, phir us se dua kar."
"3989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iftar mein jaldi karo aur sehri mein dair karo."
"3990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makka ki taraf nikalne mein jaldi karo, kyunke tum mein se koi nahi janta ke use kiya beemari ya hajat pesh aaye."
"3991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hauz ke bartanon ki tadaad aasman ke taron ki tadaad jitni hai."
"3992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabar ka azaab haq hai."
"3993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka azaab us ki duniya mein hai."
"3994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ka azaab us ki duniya mein us ke haathon mein rakha gaya hai."
"3995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aurat ko billi ki wajah se azaab diya gaya jise us ne qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo bhook se mar gayi; pas wo us ki wajah se aag mein dakhil hui. Allah ne farmaya: Jab tune use qaid kiya to na tune use khilaya na pilaya, aur na tune use chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore kha le."
"3996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aurat ko bille ki wajah se azaab diya gaya jise us ne bandha yahan tak ke wo mar gaya, aur us ne use na chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore kha le; pas us ki wajah se us ke liye aag wajib ho gayi."
"3997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe upar le jaya gaya yahan tak ke main aisi bulandi par zahir hua jahan main qalamon ki khar-kharahat sunta tha."
"3998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arsh Musa ke arsh jaisa hai."
"3999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ummatein pesh ki gayin to maine Nabi dekha jin ke saath jamaat thi, aur Nabi jin ke saath aik ya do aadmi thay, aur Nabi jin ke saath koi na tha; phir mere saamne aik azeem siyahi uthayi gayi to maine samjha ke wo meri ummat hai, to mujh se kaha gaya: Ye Musa aur un ki qaum hain, lekin ufuq ki taraf dekho; to aik azeem siyahi thi, to mujh se kaha gaya: Doosre ufuq ki taraf dekho; to aik azeem siyahi thi, to mujh se kaha gaya: Ye tumhari ummat hai aur un ke saath sattar hazaar hain jo baghair hisab aur azaab ke jannat mein dakhil honge; wo wo hain jo dam nahi karte, dam nahi karwate, bad-shaguni nahi lete, daagh nahi lagwate aur apne Rab par tawakkul karte hain."
"4000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe din pesh kiye gaye to un mein mujhe juma ka din pesh kiya gaya; wo safed aaine jaisa tha aur us ke darmiyan aik kaala nuqta tha. Maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Kaha gaya: Qayamat ki ghari."
"4001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe jannat pesh ki gayi yahan tak ke agar main apna haath barhata to us ke khoshon mein se le leta; aur mujhe aag pesh ki gayi to main phoonkne laga is darr se ke us ki garmi tumhein gher le; aur maine us mein Allah ke Rasool ke oont ki chori karne wale ko dekha, aur maine us mein Banu Duda ke bhai ko dekha jo hajiyon ka maal churata tha; phir jab wo pakra jata to kehta: Ye unkade ka kaam hai. Aur maine us mein aik lambi siyah aurat ko dekha jise billi ki wajah se azaab diya ja raha tha jise us ne bandha tha; na us ne use khilaya na pilaya aur na use chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore kha le yahan tak ke wo mar gayi. Aur beshak suraj aur chand kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se nahi girhante, lekin wo Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; pas jab un mein se koi girhan lag jaye to Allah azza wa jal ke zikr ki taraf daudo."
"4002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe abhi is deewar ke saamne jannat aur aag pesh ki gayin; maine aaj jaise bhalayi aur burayi mein kuch nahi dekha. Aur agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote."
"4003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mujhe apne aamaal ke saath pesh ki gayi, un ke achche aur bure; to maine un ke aamaal ki khoobiyon mein raaste se takleef-deh cheez hatana dekha, aur maine un ke bure aamaal mein masjid mein thook dekha jo dafn na kiya gaya ho."
"4004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ambiya pesh kiye gaye: Musa mardon mein se aik qism ke hain goya Shanua ke mardon mein se hain; aur maine Isa Ibn Maryam ko dekha to jinhein maine dekha un mein shabahat mein sab se qareeb Urwa bin Masood thay; aur maine Ibrahim ko dekha to jinhein maine dekha un mein shabahat mein sab se qareeb tumhare saathi thay, yani khud aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam; aur maine Jibreel ko dekha to jinhein maine dekha un mein shabahat mein sab se qareeb Dihya thay."
"4005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arafat saara mauqif hai."
"4006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arafat saara mauqif hai aur Batn-e-Urna se unche raho; Muzdalifa saara mauqif hai aur Batn-e-Muhassir se unche raho; aur Mina saara qurbangah hai."
"4007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa ke chhappar jaisa chhappar: ghaas-phoos aur chhoti lakriyan; aur muamla us se zyada jaldi wala hai."
"4008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad koi mard wo baat bayan kare jo us ke aur us ki biwi ke darmiyan ho, ya shayad koi aurat wo baat bayan kare jo us ke aur us ke shohar ke darmiyan ho; pas aisa na karo, kyunke us ki misaal aisi hai jaise shaitan jo khule raaste mein shaitani se mila phir us se mila jabke log dekh rahe hon."
"4009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitrat se das cheezein hain: moonchh katna, darhi barhana, miswak, naak mein pani dalna, nakhun katna, joron ko dhona, baghlon ke baal ukherna, naaf ke neeche ke baal mundna aur pani se istinja karna."
"4010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das jannat mein hain: Nabi jannat mein, Abu Bakr jannat mein, Umar jannat mein, Usman jannat mein, Ali jannat mein, Talha jannat mein, Zubair bin Al-Awwam jannat mein, Saad bin Malik jannat mein, Abdur Rahman bin Auf jannat mein aur Saeed bin Zaid jannat mein."
"4011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki aik jamaat safed ghar yaani Kisra ke ghar ko fatah karegi."
"4012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke do giroh jinhein Allah ne aag se mehfooz rakha: aik giroh jo Hind par jihad karega aur aik giroh jo Isa Ibn Maryam ke saath hoga."
"4013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azeem ajr azeem museebat ke saath hai; aur jab Allah kisi qaum se mohabbat karta hai to unhein aazmata hai."
"4014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ka markaz Shaam mein hai."
"4015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zimmi ki diyyat Musalmanon ki diyyat ki aadhi hai."
"4016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shibh-amd ki diyyat sakht hai amd ki diyyat jaisi, aur us ka karne wala qatl nahi kiya jayega."
"4017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ki saza talwar se hai."
"4018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum apne bachchon ke gale kyun dabati ho is ilaq se? Tum par ye hindi lakri lazim hai, kyunke us mein saat beemariyon se saat shifaen hain: un mein zaat-ul-janb bhi hai; uzra se naak mein tapkaya jata hai aur zaat-ul-janb se pehlu mein pilaya jata hai."
"4019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum apne haathon se ishara kyun karte ho goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Tum mein se aik ko bas ye kafi hai ke apna haath apni raan par rakhe phir apne bhai ko dayen aur bayen se salam kare."
"4020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kyun qatl karta hai? Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai mein pasandeeda cheez dekhe to us ke liye barkat ki dua kare."
"4021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Korha wahan latkao jahan ghar wale use dekhein."
"4022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Korha wahan latkao jahan ghar wale use dekhein, kyunke wo un ke liye adab hai."
"4023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ilm jis par amal na kiya jaye aise khazane ki tarah hai jis mein se kharch na kiya jaye."
"4024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ilm jo faida na de aise khazane ki tarah hai jis mein se kharch na kiya jaye."
"4025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saat saal ki umar ke bachche ko sikhaya karo aur das saal ki umar mein us par maro."
"4026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni aulad ko namaz sikhaya karo jab wo saat saal ke ho jayen aur unhein us par maro jab wo das saal ke ho jayen, aur un ke darmiyan bichhonon mein judayi kar do."
"4027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sikhaya karo, aasani karo aur sakhti na karo, khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilao; aur jab tum mein se koi ghussa ho to khamosh rahe."
"4028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hafsa ko cheenti ke kaatne ka dam sikha do."
"4029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina ke raston par farishte hain; us mein taaoon dakhil nahi hoga na Dajjal."
"4030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har oont ki kohan par shaitan hai; pas unhein sawari se aadi banao, kyunke sawari to Allah taala deta hai."
"4031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har oont ki peeth par shaitan hai; pas jab un par sawaar ho to Allah ka naam lo phir apni hajat poori karne mein kotahi na karo."
"4032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid ke darwazon mein se har darwaze par do farishte hain jo pehle aane walon ko tartib se likhte hain: aik shakhs jaise oont laya, aik shakhs jaise gaaye laya, aik shakhs jaise bakri laya, aik shakhs jaise parinda laya aur aik shakhs jaise anda laya; phir jab imam baith jaye to saheefe lapet diye jate hain."
"4033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har khandan par diyyat hai."
"4034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Musalman mard par har saat dinon mein ghusl hai, wo juma ka din hai."
"4035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ke har jor par har din sadqa hai, aur is sab ki taraf se Chasht ki do rakatein kafi hain."
"4036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har baaligh par juma ko jana hai aur har jo juma ko jaye us par ghusl hai."
"4037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai. Phir agar na paye to apne haath se kaam kare taake apne aap ko faida de aur sadqa kare. Phir agar is ki taqat na rakhe to hajat-mand be-qarar ki madad kare. Phir agar aisa na kare to bhalayi ka hukm de. Phir agar aisa na kare to burayi se ruke, kyunke ye us ke liye sadqa hai."
"4038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har jaan par har din jis mein suraj tuloo hua ho us ki taraf se us par sadqa hai; sadqe ke darwazon mein se: Allahu Akbar, Subhan Allah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Astaghfirullah kehna, maroof ka hukm dena, munkar se mana karna, logon ke raaste se kaanta, haddi aur pathar hatana, andhe ko raasta dikhana, behre aur goonge ko samjhana yahan tak ke samajh jaye, talabgar ko us ki hajat par rehnumayi karna jis ki jagah tum jante ho, madad ke liye cheekhte hue be-qarar ki taraf apni pindliyon ki taqat se daudna, aur kamzor ke saath apne bazuaon ki taqat se uthana; ye sab tumhari taraf se tum par sadqe ke darwaze hain. Aur tumhein apni biwi se milne mein ajr hai. Batao, agar tumhara beta hota aur wo jawan hota aur tum us ke ajr ki ummeed rakhte phir wo mar jata to kiya tum us par sawab ki niyyat karte? Kiya tum ne use paida kiya? Kiya tum ne use hidayat di? Kiya tum use rizq dete thay? Pas isi tarah use halal mein rakho aur haram se bachao; phir agar Allah chahe use zinda rakhe aur agar chahe use maut de, aur tumhare liye ajr hai."
"4039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par sunna aur itaat lazim hai apni tangi aur khush-haali mein, apni chusti aur na-pasandi mein aur apne upar tarjeeh mein."
"4040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ko lazmi pakro, kyunke ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalayi bandhi hui hai."
"4041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi ko lazmi pakro; beshak narmi jis cheez mein ho use khubsurat bana deti hai aur jis cheez se nikaal li jaye use badnuma bana deti hai."
"4042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi ko lazmi pakro aur sakhti aur fahhash-goi se bacho."
"4043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mitti ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo tumhein kafi hai."
"4044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roze ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us jaisa kuch nahi."
"4045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijrat ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us jaisa kuch nahi. Jihad ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us jaisa kuch nahi....., roze ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us jaisa kuch nahi. Sajde ko lazmi pakro, kyunke tum Allah ko koi sajda nahi karte magar Allah us se tumhara aik darja buland karta hai aur us se tumhari aik khata mita deta hai."
"4046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala se darne aur har bulandi par takbeer kehne ko lazmi pakro."
"4047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jame dua aur us ke jawame ko lazmi pakro; kaho: Ae Allah, main tujh se har bhalayi ka sawal karta hun us ki jald aur dair se, jo main janta hun us mein se aur jo nahi janta; aur teri panah mangta hun har burayi se us ki jald aur dair se, jo main janta hun us mein se aur jo nahi janta. Aur tujh se jannat ka sawal karta hun aur us qaul ya amal ka jo us ke qareeb kare, aur teri panah mangta hun aag se aur us qaul ya amal se jo us ke qareeb kare. Aur tujh se us ka sawal karta hun jo tujh se Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne manga aur teri panah mangta hun us se jis se Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne teri panah mangi. Aur jo faisla tune mere liye kiya us ka anjaam durust kar de."
"4048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Husn-e-akhlaq aur lambi khamoshi ko lazmi pakro; pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, makhlooq ne un donon jaisi kisi cheez se zeenat nahi payi."
"4049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achchi guftagu aur khana khilane ko lazmi pakro."
"4050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kasrat se sajda karne ko lazmi pakro, kyunke tum Allah ko koi sajda nahi karte magar Allah us se tumhara aik darja buland karta hai aur us se tumhari aik khata mita deta hai."
"4051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chamre ki mashkon ko lazmi pakro jin ke muh bandhe jate hon."
"4052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhalayi karne ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo buri maut se bachata hai; aur chhupe sadqe ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo Rab azza wa jal ke ghusse ko bujhata hai."
"4053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kunwariyon ko lazmi pakro, kyunke un ke munh zyada meethe, rehem zyada saaf, qubul zyada garm aur thore amal par zyada raazi hain."
"4054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sote waqt ismid lagaya karo, kyunke wo nazar tez karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"4055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ismid lagaya karo, kyunke wo baal ugata hai, mail door karta hai aur nazar saaf karta hai."
"4056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ismid lagaya karo, kyunke wo nazar tez karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"4057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gehray siyah bail se bacho jis mein do nuqte hon, kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"4058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah ko lazmi pakro; pas jo taqat na rakhe us par roza lazim hai, kyunke wo us ke liye dhaal hai."
"4059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaaye ke doodh ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo har darakht se chugti hain aur wo har beemari se shifa hai."
"4060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaaye ke doodh ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo dawa hain aur un ke ghee ko, kyunke wo shifa hai! Aur un ke gosht se bacho, kyunke un ka gosht beemari hai."
"4061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaaye ke doodh ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo shifa hain, aur un ka ghee dawa hai aur un ka gosht beemari hai."
"4062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed kapron ko lazmi pakro; tumhare zinda use pehnein aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan dein, kyunke wo tumhare behtareen kapre hain."
"4063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein jihad ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo jannat ke darwazon mein se aik darwaza hai jis se Allah fikr aur gham door karta hai."
"4064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat ke aakhri hisse mein safar ko lazmi pakro, kyunke zameen raat mein lapeti jati hai."
"4065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teer-andazi ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo tumhare behtareen khelon mein se hai."
"4066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teer-andazi ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo tumhare behtareen mashghulon mein se hai."
"4067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sana aur sanoot ko lazmi pakro, kyunke un donon mein maut ke siwa har beemari se shifa hai, aur saam maut hai."
"4068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miswak ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo munh ki pakeezgi aur Rab ki raza hai."
"4069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaam ko lazmi pakro."
"4070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaam ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo Allah ke shehron mein muntakhab hai; us mein us ki makhlooq mein se us ke chune hue baste hain. Pas jo inkar kare wo apne Yaman se mil jaye aur apne talaab se piye; kyunke Allah azza wa jal ne mujhe Shaam aur us ke rehne walon ki zamanat di hai."
"4071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sach ko lazmi pakro, kyunke sach neki ki taraf rehnumayi karta hai aur neki jannat ki taraf rehnumayi karti hai; aur aadmi sach bolta rehta hai aur sach ka qasd karta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas siddiq likh diya jata hai. Aur jhoot se bacho, kyunke jhoot badkari ki taraf rehnumayi karta hai aur badkari aag ki taraf rehnumayi karti hai; aur aadmi jhoot bolta rehta hai aur jhoot ka qasd karta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas kazzab likh diya jata hai."
"4072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sach ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo neki ke saath hai aur ye donon jannat mein hain; aur jhoot se bacho, kyunke wo badkari ke saath hai aur ye donon aag mein hain. Aur Allah se yaqeen aur aafiyat mango, kyunke yaqeen ke baad aafiyat se behtar kisi ko kuch nahi diya gaya. Aur hasad na karo, bughz na rakho, qata-talluq na karo, peeth na phero aur Allah ke bando bhai bhai ban jao jaisa Allah ne tumhein hukm diya hai."
"4073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo jannat ke janwaron mein se hain; aur un ke baaron mein namaz parho aur un ki naak ki mitti ponchh diya karo."
"4074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed kapron ko lazmi pakro; tumhare zinda use pehnein aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan dein."
"4075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed kapron ko lazmi pakro; use pehno aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan do."
"4076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khazf ki kankariyon ko lazmi pakro jin se jamre ko mara jata hai."
"4077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki us ruksat ko lazmi pakro jo us ne tumhein di hai."
"4078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ki kanwariyon ko lazmi pakro, kyunke un ke munh zyada khushgawar aur rehem zyada saaf aur qubul zyada garm hain."
"4079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat ke qiyam ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo tum se pehle saaliheen ka tareeqa hai, Allah taala ka qurb hai, gunah se rokne wala hai, buraiyon ka kaffara hai aur jism se beemari ko bhagane wala hai."
"4080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Peeth ke gosht ko lazmi pakro, kyunke wo sab se umda hai."
"4081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is sehri ko lazmi pakro, kyunke ye mubarak nashta hai."
"4082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is hindi lakri ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us mein saat shifaen hain: uzra se naak mein tapkaya jata hai aur zaat-ul-janb se pehlu mein pilaya jata hai."
"4083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is kalonji ko lazmi pakro, kyunke us mein maut ke siwa har beemari se shifa hai, aur saam maut hai."
"4084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein is namaz ko lazmi pakro, yani maghrib ki sunnat."
"4085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein se utne ko lazmi pakro jitni taqat rakho, kyunke Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao."
"4086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darmiyana rawish ko lazmi pakro; kyunke jo is deen se sakhti karega wo us par ghalib aa jayega."
"4087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae aurato, tasbeeh, tahleel aur taqdees ko lazmi pakro aur ungliyon ke poron par gino, kyunke un se sawal hoga aur unhein bolne ki taqat di jayegi; aur ghaflat na karo warna rehmat bhool jaogi."
"4088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un par wo hai jo un par dala gaya aur tum par wo hai jo tum par dala gaya."
"4089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ali bin Abi Talib us ke maula hain jis ka main maula hun."
"4090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ali meri nisbat wohi darja rakhta hai jo Harun Musa ki nisbat, siwaye is ke ke mere baad koi Nabi nahi."
"4091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ali mujh se hai aur main Ali se hun; aur meri taraf se ada nahi karega siwaye main ya Ali."
"4092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ali mera qarz ada karega."
"4093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne jaan-boojh kar kiya ae Umar."
"4094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki umar saath saal se sattar tak hai."
"4095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amr bin Al-Aas Quraish ke nek logon mein se hain."
"4096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bait-ul-Maqdis ka aabaad hona Yasrib ki barbadi hai, Yasrib ki barbadi bare qatl-e-aam ka nikalna hai, bare qatl-e-aam ka nikalna Qustuntuniyya ki fatah hai aur Qustuntuniyya ki fatah Dajjal ka nikalna hai."
"4097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan mein umrah hajj ke barabar hai."
"4098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan mein umrah mere saath hajj ki tarah hai."
"4099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne thora amal kiya aur bahut ajr paya."
"4100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ki manind hai."
"4101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ko baaghi giroh qatl karega."
"4102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ke saamne jab bhi do muamle pesh kiye gaye unhon ne un mein se zyada durust ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"4103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar haddon tak iman se bhare hue hain."
"4104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere chacha aur mere baap ke hum-mizaj Abbas."
"4105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ladke ki taraf se do barabar bakriyan aur ladki ki taraf se aik bakri."
"4106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ladke ki taraf se do bakriyan aur ladki ki taraf se aik bakri; tumhein nuqsan nahi ke nar hon ya maada."
"4107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ladke ki taraf se do aqiqay aur ladki ki taraf se aik aqiqa."
"4108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke paas bhalayi aur burayi ke khazane hain, un ki kunjiyan aadmi hain; pas khushkhabri hai us ke liye jise Allah ne bhalayi ki kunji aur burayi ka taala banaya, aur halakat hai us ke liye jise Allah ne burayi ki kunji aur bhalayi ka taala banaya."
"4109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beemar ki ayadat karo aur janaze ke peeche chalo; ye tumhein aakhirat yaad dilayenge."
"4110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki panah mango qabar ke azaab se, Allah ki panah mango aag ke azaab se, Allah ki panah mango Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se, Allah ki panah mango zindagi aur maut ke fitne se."
"4111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aankhein aag nahi dekhein gi: wo aankh jo Allah ke darr se royi aur wo aankh jo Allah ki raah mein pehra dete hue raat guzare."
"4112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aankhon ko aag nahi pahunchegi: wo aankh jo Allah ke darr se royi aur wo aankh jo Allah ki raah mein pehra dete hue raat guzare."
"4113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aankhon ko aag kabhi nahi chhuayegi: wo aankh jo Allah ke darr se royi aur wo aankh jo Allah ki raah mein pehra dete hue raat guzare."
"4114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne tohfe mein wapas lene wala apni qai mein wapas lene wale ki tarah hai."
"4115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aariyat ada ki jayegi aur ata lautayi jayegi."
"4116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aariyat ada ki jayegi, ata lautayi jayegi, qarz chukaya jayega aur zaamin zimmedar hai."
"4117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqe par haq ke saath kaam karne wala Allah azza wa jal ki raah mein jihad karne wale ki tarah hai yahan tak ke apne ghar wapas laut aaye."
"4118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande Allah ke bande hain aur sheher Allah ke sheher hain; pas jo murda zameen mein se kuch zinda kare wo us ka hai, aur zaalim rag ka koi haq nahi."
"4119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne ke daur mein ibadat meri taraf hijrat ki tarah hai."
"4120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abbas Allah ke Rasool ke chacha hain, aur beshak aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ki manind hai."
"4121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhaage hue ghulam ki namaz qabool nahi hoti yahan tak ke apne aaqaon ki taraf laut aaye."
"4122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ateera haq hai."
"4123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taajjub hai ke meri ummat mein se kuch log Quraish ke aik shakhs ke liye Baitullah ka qasd karenge jo Baitullah mein panaah liye hoga; phir jab wo Baida mein honge unhein dhansa diya jayega; un mein samajh-boojh wala, majboor aur musafir hoga; wo aik hi halakat mein halak honge aur mukhtalif anjaam par jayenge; Allah unhein un ki niyyaton par uthayega."
"4124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhute janwar ka zakhm be-jurman hai, kunwan be-jurman hai, kaan be-jurman hai aur dafeene mein panchwan hissa hai."
"4125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhute janwar ka zakhm be-jurman hai aur kaan be-jurman hai."
"4126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ajwa jannat mein se hai aur us mein zeher se shifa hai; aur khumbi mann mein se hai aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"4127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ajwa jannat mein se hai aur us mein zeher se shifa hai; aur khumbi mann mein se hai aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai.. ..."
"4128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kahaanat ki ibtida malamat hai, us ka anjaam nadamat hai aur qayamat ke din azaab hai."
"4129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usaila jima hai."
"4130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chheenk Allah ki taraf se hai aur jamahi shaitan ki taraf se; pas jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to apna haath apne munh par rakhe; aur jab wo aah aah kahe to shaitan us ke pait se hansta hai. Aur beshak Allah azza wa jal chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamahi ko na-pasand karta hai."
"4131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Diyyat qabile par hai, aur hamal zae hone mein aik ghulam ya laundi hai."
"4132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aqiqa saatwein ya chaudawein ya ikkeeswein din zibah kiya jaye."
"4133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aqiqa ladke ki taraf se haq hai: do barabar bakriyan, aur ladki ki taraf se aik bakri."
"4134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amd mein qisas hai aur khata mein diyyat hai."
"4135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umrah se umrah tak darmiyan ke gunahon aur khataon ka kaffara hai, aur maqbool hajj ka badla jannat ke siwa kuch nahi."
"4136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umrah se umrah tak darmiyan ka kaffara hai, aur maqbool hajj ka badla jannat ke siwa kuch nahi."
"4137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra apne walon ke liye jayez hai."
"4138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra apne walon ke liye jayez hai aur ruqba apne walon ke liye jayez hai."
"4139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra jis ke liye kiya gaya us ke liye jayez hai aur ruqba jis ke liye kiya gaya us ke liye jayez hai; aur apne tohfe mein wapas lene wala apni qai mein wapas lene wale ki tarah hai."
"4140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra jis ke liye tohfa diya gaya us ka hai."
"4141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra apne walon ke liye meeras hai."
"4142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chacha baap hai."
"4143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare aur un ke darmiyan ehad namaz hai; pas jo use chhore us ne kufr kiya."
"4144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar aadmi ko qabar mein dakhil karti hai aur oont ko handi mein."
"4145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai."
"4146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai: wo gunji hone tak utarti hai."
"4147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai; aur agar koi cheez taqdeer se aage barhne wali hoti to nazar us se aage barhti; aur jab tum se ghusl manga jaye to ghusl karo."
"4148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aankh pakhane ke bandhan ki tarah hai; phir jab aankh so jaye to bandhan khul jata hai."
"4149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aankh pakhane ke bandhan ki tarah hai; pas jo soye wo wuzu kare."
"4150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dono aankhein zina karti hain, dono haath zina karte hain, dono pair zina karte hain aur sharmgah zina karti hai."
